{"id":"553589889","kind":"article","title":"元认知支持作为认知脚手架","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4qFtxPZi21DKoLruHcmsocee1YnZy9JMArb6"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-08-14","updated":"2022-09-08","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":447,"keywords":["元认知支持","认知脚手架","检索练习","游戏化学习","助记媒介"],"summary":"短文说明环境可替学习者承担部分元认知工作：教师能监控和安排学习进程，带复习环节的助记文本也可帮助读者判断记忆掌握程度并规划后续练习；游戏则能支持技能评估和计划调整。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/553589889","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"aiRX1t2R\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7J71kWtJfZrdWHevwTbq6ih3G1YAvRbmXa63\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习需要元认知技能</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，不过环境可以减轻学习者的元认知负担。</p><p data-pid=\"4sguMLa1\">在课堂中，教师会大量监控、评估、计划、控制学生的执行。当然，他们有时候做得<b>太</b>多了，但是在很多情况下，这可以让学生把注意力放在手头的材料上。</p><p data-pid=\"8OattBha\">在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://quantum.country/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">量子国度</a>中，我们穿插的复习环节会帮助读者注意到他们是否掌握材料，并在他们的记忆扎实时给他们一种轻松的感觉。该环境还相应地计划和执行后续的记忆练习。</p><p data-pid=\"dbH7Eh3E\">游戏在这方面做得特别好：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"fgdRyssb\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2tZBJUtAasH3bGxHaEpFdP5zjjiWwqDsFxEM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">游戏帮助玩家评估他们养成的技能</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"i6fa4ZQc\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7mU6RxxzJ9FZBCcgbYQsv9nExuK3xVm635Ks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">游戏帮助玩家制定和调整计划</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"HdrfL_bi\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">设赋体验（Enacted experience）</a></li><li data-pid=\"aHjVGaes\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"545549661\" href=\"#/post/545549661\">学习需要元认知技能</a></li><li data-pid=\"amnmcMf5\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"457666825\" href=\"#/post/457666825\">认知脚手架</a></li><li data-pid=\"dCL45Pk6\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"454732041\" href=\"#/post/454732041\">可执行的策略</a></li><li data-pid=\"e1wo4on2\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"555033920\" href=\"#/post/555033920\">游戏能有效地培养玩家的技能</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"6TvUp4Ep\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4qFtxPZi21DKoLruHcmsocee1YnZy9JMArb6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Metacognitive supports as cognitive scaffolding (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 学习需要元认知技能 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"545549661\" href=\"#/post/545549661\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 游戏帮助玩家评估他们养成的技能 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"560849079\" href=\"#/post/560849079\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 游戏帮助玩家制定和调整计划 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"562411559\" href=\"#/post/562411559\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"545960673","title":"教育游戏试图通过情景体验进行教学","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"553842711","title":"探尝","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":7,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"454732041","titl